  "query_preview": "period of strong NE winds into the middle of next week \nwhich will likely prolong the gale force winds. Another note, the \nNBM does suggest winds will increase to gale force gusts Saturday \nnight in the lower James. This is a little early and there is some \nuncertainty in this scenario as the winds would need to turn NE. \nHowever, it is possible that a gale watch will need to be \nintroduced into the lower James as some point. \n\nSeas decrease to 2 to 4 feet tonight over the coastal waters and 1 \nto 2 ft in the bay. However, seas rapidly build on Saturday with 8 \nto 11 ft seas in the coastal waters and 4 to 7 ft in the Bay by \nSaturday night.",
